# The service stops while a host's first pass loads its alert log: it runs for 7 more looks from the pass's start.
# Four alarms are saved, the agent starts again, and the first pass is cut short; the host is initialized all the
# same, so the next pass, with the service running again, loads nothing more.
database real
rules tests/corpus/sql/save.conf
chart loop.s loop.s_name loop.sql disks things 1
label loop.s kind ssd
chart loop.t loop.t_name loop.sql disks things 1
label loop.t kind hdd
var loop.s v 10
var loop.t v 70
clock 0
pass 0
clock 1
pass 1
clock 100
restart
clock 101
running-for 7
pass 101
running 1
clock 102
pass 102
clock 103
pass 103
